WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.172 --> 00:00:13.961
"Ugh!" Terrell thought.

2
00:00:13.981 --> 00:00:16.163
"Another earthquake!"

3
00:00:17.343 --> 00:00:19.525
Miss Apricot's students hid under their desks.

4
00:00:20.466 --> 00:00:21.767
A globe rolled off a table.

5
00:00:22.447 --> 00:00:23.728
Books fell from shelves.

6
00:00:24.589 --> 00:00:28.151
Terrell tried to text Roxy again, but his messages still weren't going through.

7
00:00:29.004 --> 00:00:31.947
He texted Roxy's mom, and she texted back right away.

8
00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:35.250
She was worried too—she couldn't reach Roxy either.

9
00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:37.071
The shaking stopped.

10
00:00:37.892 --> 00:00:39.353
Miss Apricot picked up the globe.

11
00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:42.236
"Everyone, let's clean up!"

12
00:00:43.317 --> 00:00:45.138
Terrell, Jack, and Mara picked up books.

13
00:00:45.158 --> 00:00:49.082
"We should have an earthquake day," Jack said.

14
00:00:49.102 --> 00:00:51.784
"It would be like a snow day but more fun!"

15
00:00:52.545 --> 00:00:53.886
Mara gave him a funny look.

16
00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:55.708
"You think this is fun?

17
00:00:56.408 --> 00:00:57.269
I'm dizzy!

18
00:00:57.729 --> 00:00:59.370
I might need to go to the nurse."

19
00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:01.871
"Hey!" Jack suddenly said.

20
00:01:01.891 --> 00:01:03.412
"Is Roxy okay?

21
00:01:03.892 --> 00:01:05.573
She went to the nurse hours ago."

22
00:01:05.593 --> 00:01:09.135
"I just got a text from her," Terrell said quickly.

23
00:01:09.155 --> 00:01:11.596
"Her, um, mom picked her up."

24
00:01:12.477 --> 00:01:14.037
"Attention, please!"

25
00:01:14.478 --> 00:01:16.699
Principal Penn's voice came over the loudspeaker.

26
00:01:16.719 --> 00:01:20.501
"We're dismissing early today because of the earthquakes."

27
00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:22.462
Jack pumped his fist.

28
00:01:23.062 --> 00:01:25.944
"Yes! It's our first earthquake day!"

29
00:01:26.516 --> 00:01:28.637
Mara rolled her eyes as she packed her things.

30
00:01:30.058 --> 00:01:31.099
Everyone went outside.

31
00:01:31.639 --> 00:01:34.280
A line of cars slowly made its way past the entrance.

32
00:01:34.921 --> 00:01:36.322
One by one, students left.

33
00:01:37.342 --> 00:01:39.063
Finally Terrell saw Roxy's mom.

34
00:01:40.704 --> 00:01:41.565
She looked worried.

35
00:01:43.766 --> 00:01:45.967
Terrell got in the car and buckled his seatbelt.

36
00:01:46.627 --> 00:01:48.068
Roxy's mom started to drive.

37
00:01:48.088 --> 00:01:50.390
"Did you hear from Roxy yet?"

38
00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:54.452
"No." Terrell tried texting Roxy again.

39
00:01:55.028 --> 00:01:56.528
That message didn't go through either.

40
00:01:57.349 --> 00:01:58.449
Roxy's mom frowned.

41
00:01:58.469 --> 00:02:02.030
"She told me earlier that she had a Rocket Girl mission.

42
00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:04.171
But that was hours ago."

43
00:02:04.191 --> 00:02:08.492
"She might be trying to stop the earthquakes," Terrell said.

44
00:02:08.512 --> 00:02:10.092
"I'll check the news.

45
00:02:10.733 --> 00:02:12.153
Maybe there's a story about it."

46
00:02:13.013 --> 00:02:14.854
He scrolled though the news app on his phone.

47
00:02:15.414 --> 00:02:17.475
He saw lots of headlines about the earthquakes.

48
00:02:18.035 --> 00:02:19.895
But there wasn't anything about Rocket Girl.

49
00:02:20.735 --> 00:02:21.476
Terrell groaned.

50
00:02:23.292 --> 00:02:25.853
"I don't understand why my messages won't go through.

51
00:02:26.473 --> 00:02:27.973
Unless she's in outer space?

52
00:02:28.574 --> 00:02:30.014
But then what can we do?

53
00:02:30.654 --> 00:02:33.275
She could be anywhere in the He gasped.

54
00:02:33.295 --> 00:02:34.995
"Galaxy Squad!"

55
00:02:35.015 --> 00:02:37.376
"What about the Galaxy Squad?"

56
00:02:37.756 --> 00:02:38.636
Roxy's mom asked.

57
00:02:39.477 --> 00:02:41.557
"I'm a member," Terrell said proudly.

58
00:02:41.577 --> 00:02:44.538
"And that means, I know who to call!"

59
00:02:44.558 --> 00:02:46.839
"Shaking, Earth!"

60
00:02:47.299 --> 00:02:47.899
Bippo said.

61
00:02:48.719 --> 00:02:51.240
Dr. Odd flew his mobile lab over Metro City.

62
00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.160
He headed toward the mountains.

63
00:02:53.721 --> 00:02:56.061
Down below, another earthquake shook the buildings.

64
00:02:56.961 --> 00:02:57.902
Finally it stopped.

65
00:02:58.882 --> 00:03:00.182
Dr. Odd checked a screen.

66
00:03:01.162 --> 00:03:03.883
"The earthquakes are getting much stronger."

67
00:03:04.643 --> 00:03:05.504
His phone buzzed.

68
00:03:05.524 --> 00:03:08.264
"Hello?" "Dr.

69
00:03:08.544 --> 00:03:09.625
Odd!" Terrell said.

70
00:03:09.645 --> 00:03:12.986
"I'm very busy, Terrell," Dr.

71
00:03:13.106 --> 00:03:13.606
Odd said.

72
00:03:13.626 --> 00:03:16.667
"Mayor Bloom asked me to investigate the earthquakes.

73
00:03:17.407 --> 00:03:19.027
I'm heading toward their source now.

74
00:03:19.647 --> 00:03:21.588
Metro City is in big danger."

75
00:03:22.556 --> 00:03:25.938
"I think Rocket Girl is in danger too," Terrell said.

76
00:03:25.958 --> 00:03:28.199
"I don't know where she is."

77
00:03:28.219 --> 00:03:31.181
"Hmm." Dr.

78
00:03:31.281 --> 00:03:32.261
Odd scratched his head.

79
00:03:32.281 --> 00:03:34.483
"She probably just went home."

80
00:03:35.123 --> 00:03:36.204
"No, she didn't!"

81
00:03:36.404 --> 00:03:37.404
Roxy's mom said.

82
00:03:37.424 --> 00:03:39.125
"I'm her mom.

83
00:03:39.545 --> 00:03:41.126
We're very worried!"

84
00:03:41.146 --> 00:03:43.007
"Oh dear."

85
00:03:44.648 --> 00:03:46.229
Dr. Odd pressed some buttons.

86
00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:49.831
"I'm sending you a location.

87
00:03:50.291 --> 00:03:51.152
Can you meet me there?"

88
00:03:51.988 --> 00:03:54.189
"Yes, of course," Roxy's mom said.

89
00:03:54.209 --> 00:03:56.770
A location appeared on Terrell's phone.

90
00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:58.171
It was in the mountains.

91
00:03:59.071 --> 00:04:01.192
"We're on our way," Terrell said.

92
00:04:01.212 --> 00:04:03.233
"Good," Dr.

93
00:04:03.353 --> 00:04:03.873
Odd said.

94
00:04:03.893 --> 00:04:08.175
"Because the people of Metro City now have two big problems.

95
00:04:08.775 --> 00:04:10.316
They need the Galaxy Squad!"
